warze Kreatur mit Stärke und Widerstandskraft der begrabenen Kreatur. Begrabe den Schatten-Spielstein am Ende des Zuges.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f8d139c-dc56-4f6a-b5ce-d41e67bfb5f9'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Imagen rota', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '14c39fad-90c3-4d16-8a5a-b646908ec43d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Visage brisé', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7235095f-92aa-47dc-9488-2d7fcf1c8ca2'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Immagine Infranta', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44e8b98c-fb62-4462-bf04-e81e79d1d5d0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Imagem Estilhaçada', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '381a628c-c456-4189-bde6-8bc5e50a71fb'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Gespenstische Bären', 'text': 'Wenn die gespenstischen Bären angreifen und der verteidigende Spieler keine schwarzen Karten beherrscht, enttappen sie nicht in Deiner nächsten Enttap-Phase.', 'type': 'Beschwörung von Bären', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6283ee48-966a-4b83-a8e5-5dfa35a09e55'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Osos espectrales', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41234cbf-f62f-4da5-9f68-5facbaf9cfa4'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ours spectraux', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '376a1210-75cf-4c69-bacd-d603bbf08192'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Orsi Spettrali', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a43e559-4da8-4ee2-93d7-bcf56eca27bf'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ursos Espectrais', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2755effc-8bf9-4a6c-bcd7-7af2e1219032'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Gezackte Pfeile', 'text': 'L